title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Start screen
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 'Referral', no referral loaded yet)
intro: What a person sees on step 1 before a referral is loaded. Drop documents (Reader reads them), use the sample, check a referral that already arrived, or go on without one.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Reader's reading is invented. The same file name always gives the same one of three sample referrals.
---
start s1 "Open New case\nBlank draft, step 'Referral'"
start s2 "Click 'Back' or 'Add a referral'\non the Medical records step"
start s3 "Click 'Use different documents'\non a referral checklist"

screen sc1 "New case › Referral\n'Start with the referral. Drop the documents and Reader lists anything that is missing.'"

group gDrop "Drop the documents"
  input i1 "Drop files on 'Drop the referral documents'\nor click it and choose files"
  process p1 "Reader picks one of three invented referrals\nfrom the first file name"
  click c2 "Click 'Use sample referral'"
  process p2 "Takes the next invented referral in turn\n(file: referral.pdf)"
endgroup

screen sc2 "'Reader is reading 1 document'\nFile names (first three, then 'and N more')"
agent a1 "Reader reads, about one second each:\nScanning the documents\nChecking the program's requirements\nVerifying required components\nConfirming the data is complete"
click leave "Leave the page while Reader reads\n(no Cancel button on this screen)"
endx e1 "Nothing is added"
store st1 "New referral added, next RF number\nStatus New, received just now"
toast t1 "'Reader read the documents'\n'RF-2054 is ready. The checklist shows what is missing.'"
toast t2 "Bell notification 'New referral read'\n'RF-2054 from Eastgate Probation Services is on your checklist in New case.'"
process p3 "Address gets ?ref=RF-2054\nChecklist opens"
goto g1 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Referral checklist"

group gArr "Already arrived"
  screen sc3 "'Already arrived (8)'\n'Referrals that came in by fax, e-referral, the portal or phone. Reader has read each one.'"
  process p4 "Open referrals only: New, In review, Awaiting info\nEmergent, then urgent, then routine; waiting-on-referrer last"
  process p5 "Each row: initials and age, RF number, urgency, source, channel, time\nPill: 'n to check', 'Nothing to check' or 'Waiting on the referrer'"
  decision d1 "More than 6 open referrals?"
  click c3 "Click 'Show 2 more'"
  process p6 "All rows show\nButton now reads 'Show fewer'"
  click c4 "Click 'Show fewer'"
  click c5 "Click 'Check' on a row"
  process p7 "Referral marked opened\nSidebar badge on 'New case' drops"
endgroup
decision d2 "Any open referral?"
process p8 "Whole 'Already arrived' section is hidden"

group gNone "No referral"
  click c6 "Click 'No referral? Continue without one'"
  process p9 "Step moves to Medical records\nNo referral is attached"
endgroup
goto g2 "Continues in: New case › Medical records"

s1 --> sc1
s2 --> sc1
s3 --> sc1

sc1 --> i1 --> p1 --> sc2
sc1 --> c2 --> p2 --> sc2
sc2 --> a1 --> st1 --> t1 --> p3 --> g1
st1 -.-> t2
sc2 --> leave --> e1

sc1 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| sc3 --> p4 --> p5 --> d1
d2 -->|No| p8
d1 -->|Yes| c3 --> p6 --> c4
d1 -->|No| c5
p6 --> c5
c4 -.-> d1
c5 --> p7 --> g1

sc1 --> c6 --> p9 --> g2
